{"title":"My thoughts on pharma pricing for The Free Press","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/918397904/0/marginalrevolution~My-thoughts-on-pharma-pricing-for-The-Free-Press.html","date":1747380384000,"content":"<p>Here is an excerpt:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>Begin with a basic fact. Generics account <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.perplexity.ai/search/generics-are-about-ninety-perc-c8feqk_TRpO5KOr_wJJoJg\">for about 90 percent</a> of all prescriptions, and for those drugs Americans <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.rand.org/pubs/research_reports/RRA788-3.html\">pay</a><em><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.rand.org/pubs/research_reports/RRA788-3.html\"> less</a> </em>than the OECD (Organization for Economic Cooperation and Development) average. So while Americans do pay much higher prices for many new drugs, most of the time, for drugs like metformin, atorvastatin, and amoxicillin, they are getting a bargain.</p>\r\n<p>Furthermore, high American healthcare expenditures are <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.bloomberg.com/view/articles/2017-07-20/spending-a-lot-on-health-care-is-the-american-way\">in line</a> with our penchant for higher consumption spending in other sectors of the economy as well. Compared to Europeans, we also spend more on leisure and just about everything else.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.thefp.com/p/the-hidden-cruelty-of-capping-drug-prices?taid=68250dccc18eaf0001eb3f25&amp;utm_campaign=trueanthem&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_source=twitter\" target=\"_blank\">the full piece</a> — don’t be a Supervillain!</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/my-thoughts-on-pharma-pricing-for-the-free-press.html\">My thoughts on pharma pricing for The Free Press</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/918397904/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/918397904/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/918397904/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/918397904/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/918397904/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/918397904/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/my-thoughts-on-pharma-pricing-for-the-free-press.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/my-thoughts-on-pharma-pricing-for-the-free-press.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/my-thoughts-on-pharma-pricing-for-the-free-press.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/my-thoughts-on-pharma-pricing-for-the-free-press.html#comment-160915513\">In reply to Peanut's Ghost.   Classical liberalism? I must have ...</a> <i>by Picador</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/my-thoughts-on-pha